every 2 from 900 to 1300: temp 388 236 518 345 1290
every 2 from 1300 to 1700: temp 388 236 518 345 1290
every 2 from 1700 to 1900: temp 388 236 518 345 1290
every 2 from 1900 to 2110: temp 388 236 518 345 1290
